  "steps": [
   "Heat the oven to 220°C (200°C fan). On a roasting tray, toss the halved potatoes, sliced peppers and onion wedges with the oil, 1 tsp paprika, thyme leaves and salt. Roast for 25 minutes.",
   "Add the halved, stoned plums and drizzle with the vinegar. Lay the mackerel on top, skin up, and season.",
